{"id":"wb-5-349","name":"荆紫关古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"荆紫关古建筑群","text":"荆紫关古建筑群位于河南省南阳市淅川县荆紫关镇，是保存较为完好的一条明清时期的古建筑群，现存明清两代房舍2200多间和店铺700多间。主要古代建筑有：荆紫关古街道、关门、山陕会馆、禹王宫、平浪宫、万寿宫、法海寺、清真寺、一脚踏三省碑亭等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%86%E7%B4%AB%E5%85%B3%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86545615,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86545615","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2d2bcc1db58bb63a3c08f76b.jpg","title":"Jzgz_(7).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jzgz_(7).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Jzgz_%287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"襄樊一夜","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"jingziguan town","width":320,"height":212}}